# Gemini API Rules

## Models
- Card generation: `gemini-1.5-flash` (fast, good quality)
- Complex analysis: `gemini-1.5-pro` (slower, higher quality)

## Rate Limits & Retry
- Free tier: ~15 RPM flash, 2 RPM pro
- Always implement exponential backoff with at least 2 retries
- Sleep 500ms between chunk requests to avoid 429s

## Card Generation
- Chunk PDF text to ~3000 tokens per request
- Always validate JSON response before inserting to DB
- Deduplicate cards by front text (first 60 chars)
- Cap at 60 cards per deck

## Prompt Rules
- System prompt must request JSON-only output
- Extract with regex `/\[[\s\S]*\]/` in case of markdown wrapping
- Require both `front` and `back` fields; reject cards missing either
- `tags` is optional, default to empty array if missing
